  "title": "Retractable Technologies, Inc. Announces Workforce Reduction",
  "summary": "LITTLE ELM, Texas – Retractable Technologies, Inc. (NYSE American: RVP) reports that it has reduced its workforce by approximately 16%. The reduction is expected to save an estimated $2.2 million in annual wages and employment benefits, or approximately 13% of total estimated workforce costs. The expected savings are offset by estimated one-time separation payments of […]",
